Title:  I don't want to scream it

Seq:    5.8.10.3.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Dylan, Bob|Bob Dylan]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in Like A Rolling Stone: Bob Dylan at the Crossroads (Dylan)|Like A Rolling Stone: Bob Dylan at the Crossroads]]*

Body:

Hey, man, you know, I can’t…. I mean I’m just me, you know. I can’t, really, man, *I’m just playing the song*. I know — I don’t want to scream it, that’s all I know —

